# value-line-string-literal-punctuation

## Input

```
a value "quoted" text
b [1, 2, 3]
path /usr/local/bin

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..54
  ENTRY@0..22
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    LINE_STRING@2..21
      STRING@2..21 "value \"quoted\" text"
    NEWLINE@21..22 "\n"
  ENTRY@22..34
    WORD_KEY@22..23
      WORD@22..23 "b"
    SPACE@23..24 " "
    LINE_STRING@24..33
      STRING@24..33 "[1, 2, 3]"
    NEWLINE@33..34 "\n"
  ENTRY@34..54
    WORD_KEY@34..38
      WORD@34..38 "path"
    SPACE@38..39 " "
    LINE_STRING@39..53
      STRING@39..53 "/usr/local/bin"
    NEWLINE@53..54 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@2..21 "value \"quoted\" text",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@22..23 "b",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@24..33 "[1, 2, 3]",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@34..38 "path",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@39..53 "/usr/local/bin",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

